			, Cratin.in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cod.Vat.Gr.</u>
				122
			</span></i>: perh., =
			<i>much</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				201.13
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Nubia</span>).</div>
